      "text": "For Respondent(s) : Mr. S.S. Rajpurohit, PP.\n HON'BLE MR. JUSTICE KULDEEP MATHUR Order 13/05/2024 This anticipatory bail application under Section 438 Cr.P.C. has been filed by the petitioner apprehending his arrest in connection with FIR No.49/2024, registered at Police Station Raipur, District Pali, for the offences under Sections 498A, 406, 323 and 313 of the IPC.",
